#. Translators: Name of the section containing Terminal Copy commands in NVDA's Input Gestures dialog.
#. Add-on summary/title, usually the user visible name of the add-on
#. Translators: Summary/title for this add-on
#. to be shown on installation and add-on information found in add-on store
#: addon/appModules/windowsterminal.py:35 buildVars.py:20
msgid "Terminal Copy"
msgstr "Terminal Copy"

#. Translators: Description of the command that marks a region using the review cursor.
#: addon/appModules/windowsterminal.py:73
msgid "Set or clear a Terminal Copy region mark"
msgstr "Eine Bereichsmarke für Terminal Copy setzen oder löschen"

#. Translators: Announced after both Terminal Copy region marks are cleared.
#: addon/appModules/windowsterminal.py:82
msgid "Region marks cleared"
msgstr "Bereichsmarken gelöscht"

#. Translators: Announced when the review cursor is not in Windows Terminal's UIA text.
#: addon/appModules/windowsterminal.py:87
msgid "Move the review cursor to Windows Terminal text first"
msgstr "Bewegen Sie zuerst den NVDA-Cursor auf Text in Windows Terminal"

#. Translators: Announced when region marks are placed in different terminal tabs or buffers.
#: addon/appModules/windowsterminal.py:93
msgid "Both marks must be in the same terminal buffer"
msgstr "Beide Marken müssen sich im selben Terminalpuffer befinden"

#. Translators: Announced after the first Terminal Copy region mark is set.
#: addon/appModules/windowsterminal.py:97
msgid "Start mark set"
msgstr "Anfangsmarke gesetzt"

#. Translators: Announced after the second Terminal Copy region mark is set.
#: addon/appModules/windowsterminal.py:100
msgid "End mark set"
msgstr "Endmarke gesetzt"

#. Translators: Description of the command that copies the marked Windows Terminal region.
#: addon/appModules/windowsterminal.py:104
msgid "Copy the marked Windows Terminal region"
msgstr "Den markierten Bereich in Windows Terminal kopieren"

#. Translators: Announced when another Terminal Copy operation is still running.
#: addon/appModules/windowsterminal.py:112
msgid "A copy operation is already in progress"
msgstr "Ein Kopiervorgang läuft bereits"

#. Translators: Announced when copy is requested before both region marks are set.
#: addon/appModules/windowsterminal.py:118
msgid "Set start and end marks first"
msgstr "Setzen Sie zuerst Anfangs- und Endmarke"

#. Translators: Announced when saved UIA ranges are no longer valid.
#. Translators: Announced when a saved region cannot be accessed from the Windows lock screen.
#: addon/appModules/windowsterminal.py:123
#: addon/appModules/windowsterminal.py:127
msgid "The marked region is no longer available"
msgstr "Der markierte Bereich ist nicht mehr verfügbar"

#. Translators: Announced while a potentially large terminal region is copied.
#: addon/appModules/windowsterminal.py:137
msgid "Copying marked region"
msgstr "Markierter Bereich wird kopiert"

#. Translators: Announced after the marked terminal region is copied successfully.
#: addon/appModules/windowsterminal.py:171
msgid "Marked region copied"
msgstr "Markierter Bereich wurde kopiert"

#. Translators: Announced when the marked terminal region could not be copied.
#: addon/appModules/windowsterminal.py:174
msgid "Unable to copy the marked region"
msgstr "Der markierte Bereich konnte nicht kopiert werden"

#. Add-on description
#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-on store
#: buildVars.py:23
msgid ""
"Copies regions from Windows Terminal using NVDA's review cursor,\n"
"including available scrollback outside the visible viewport."
msgstr ""
"Kopiert Bereiche aus Windows Terminal mit dem NVDA-Cursor,\n"
"einschließlich verfügbarer Inhalte des Bildlaufpuffers außerhalb des sichtbaren Bereichs."

#. Brief changelog for this version
#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
#: buildVars.py:29
msgid "Initial release with review-cursor region copying."
msgstr "Erste Veröffentlichung zum Kopieren von Bereichen mit dem NVDA-Cursor."
